the whole morning.

1661
01:42:01.575 --> 01:42:03.367
I didn't call you, okay?

1662
01:42:07.325 --> 01:42:08.367
I called you?

1663
01:42:08.617 --> 01:42:09.617
Yes.

1664
01:42:17.658 --> 01:42:19.283
