or not lies in the hands of God."

1666
01:42:23.408 --> 01:42:26.700
<i>But I will die if I don't even try.</i>

1667
01:42:27.325 --> 01:42:28.742
<i>That's why I am going.</i>

1668
01:42:29.533 --> 01:42:31.367
