1671
01:42:37.242 --> 01:42:39.408
<i>We both have to cross
some borders, bro.</i>

1672
01:42:39.867 --> 01:42:41.367
<i>We both have a long way
ahead of us.</i>

1673
01:42:42.117 --> 01:42:46.617
<i>I am trying with all my heart
and soul to reach Kartika.</i>

1674
01:42:47.575 --> 01:42:52.700
<i>Bro, you haven't tried until you try
with all your heart and soul.</i>

1675
01:42:53.242 --> 01:42:54.533
<i>May God be with you.</i>

1676
01:42:54.908 --> 01:42:56.492
What is this, Gautam?

1677
01:42:57.617 --> 01:42:58.575
That boy...

1678
01:42:59.533 --> 01:43:00.617
what did he do?

1679
01:43:26.158 --> 01:43:28.033
<i>You have a voicemail.</i>

1680
01:43:28.117 --> 01:43:30.867
<i>Kartika, I am coming.</i>

1681
01:43:32.158 --> 01:43:36.408
<i>Please wait for me
if I get held up.</i>

1682
01:43:38.658 --> 01:43:43.033
<i>If there is a God you believe in,</i>

1683
01:43:43.742 --> 01:43:46.075
<i>please pray for me, will you?</i>

1684
01:43:47.367 --> 01:43:48.617
<i>I love you.</i>

1685
01:44:01.117 --> 01:44:02.117
Hello, Jaggi?

1686
